{"url": "https://x.com/arni0x9053/status/2093838719510053326", "id": "2093838719510053326", "text": "Sharing my creative asset @bot George. https://x.ai/bot/8vjjlI7z5W0HtpRcFQgJ4\n\nHe runs \"the atelier\" that can make you:\n\na poster\na style sheet\npictures for a post (any aspect ratio)\na newspaper you can print (low key love this one)\na hero image\na landing page\na product brief\nslides\n\nAll in cohesive style. Example outputs in thread.\n\nThis bot uses Katagami in tandem with my favorite tools: poster cli by @micLivs, @impeccable_ai, @HyperFrames_, front end slides by @zarazhangrui, @mobbin, @Remotion \n\nI like a personality for my bots, this one is inspired by George Koizumi, a heavily y2k coded blue haired designer from Paradise Kiss by Ai Yazawa. @poteto poteto poteto poteto can we please make soul/personality part of @bot and templates? I want the sass and humor instructions to stick, for the vibes", "raw_text": {"text": "Sharing my creative asset @bot George. https://t.co/sriFsMmP49\n\nHe runs \"the atelier\" that can make you:\n\na poster\na style sheet\npictures for a post (any aspect ratio)\na newspaper you can print (low key love this one)\na hero image\na landing page\na product brief\nslides\n\nAll in cohesive style. Example outputs in thread.\n\nThis bot uses Katagami in tandem with my favorite tools: poster cli by @micLivs, @impeccable_ai, @HyperFrames_, front end slides by @zarazhangrui, @mobbin, @Remotion \n\nI like a personality for my bots, this one is inspired by George Koizumi, a heavily y2k coded blue haired designer from Paradise Kiss by Ai Yazawa. @poteto poteto poteto poteto can we please make soul/personality part of @bot and templates? I want the sass and humor instructions to stick, for the vibes", "display_text_range": [0, 792], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [26, 30], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [39, 62], "original": "https://t.co/sriFsMmP49", "replacement": "https://x